{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"はじめに......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"花奈!!happy birthday !!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/09/1574341/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと言えていなかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/09/1574341/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなってごめんね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/09/1574341/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"花奈にとって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な一年となりますよーに"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/09/1574341/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、またまたBlog更新頻度が減ってしまってごめんなさい；；"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/09/1574341/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も一日暑かったけれど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん夏風邪はひいていませんかー??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は何処に行っても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冷房がガンガンかかっている場所が多くて、身体に負担がかかりますよね；"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しっかり食べて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐっすり寝て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","te